## 20. Build and release gates

The release script shall run, at minimum:

```text
:app:testDebugUnitTest
:app:lintDebug
:app:assembleRelease
```

It shall verify application ID, version name/code, signing certificate, APK signature, checksum, and non-overwrite policy. Official signed APK is stored outside Git. Credentials, signing stores, local SDK paths, device exports, and diagnostics are ignored.

Release 3.0.0 passes only when unit/lint/release build, contract fixtures, encrypted database tests, and required physical-device acceptance have fresh evidence.

